346
00:26:21,779 --> 00:26:24,879
泣きたい日も
On days I want to cry,

347
00:26:24,879 --> 00:26:29,879
くじけそうな日も
and on days I feel like giving up,

348
00:26:29,879 --> 00:26:33,879
乗り越えよう
let's rise above them!

349
00:26:34,679 --> 00:26:39,379
光 希望を 浴びなきゃ
Unless we bathe in light and hope,

350
00:26:39,379 --> 00:26:43,879
