352
00:26:46,879 --> 00:26:48,179
Are you ready GO!

353
00:26:48,779 --> 00:26:50,479
走り出そう！
Let's start running!

354
00:26:50,479 --> 00:26:53,479
取り急ぎ さぁ スタート！
First things first, let's start!

355
00:26:53,479 --> 00:26:55,279
うつむかない！
No looking down!

356
00:26:55,279 --> 00:26:57,079
ふりむかない！
No looking back!

357
00:26:57,079 --> 00:26:59,479
明日は絶対もっと Shiny!
Tomorrow will definitely be even more shiny!

358
00:26:59,479 --> 00:27:01,279
ジブン次第！
It's all up to me!

359
00:27:01,279 --> 00:27:03,079
掴め未来！
Seize the future!

360
00:27:03,079 --> 00:27:06,079
今すぐスタートボタン
Let's press the start button

361
00:27:06,079 --> 00:27:08,279
押してみよう
