374
00:28:08,279 --> 00:28:10,479
私は
I know that I...

375
00:28:10,479 --> 00:28:14,079
こんなんじゃないはず！
...am not supposed to be like this!

376
00:28:36,879 --> 00:28:40,879
こんなんじゃない！
This isn't how it ends!

377
00:28:50,479 --> 00:28:52,279
