君の隣だけは譲る気はないのです！
...but the spot right next to you is one thing I'll never give up!

698
00:52:33,912 --> 00:52:36,412
僕らが出会えた
In this miraculous world

699
00:52:36,412 --> 00:52:38,912
奇跡のセカイ
where we were able to meet,

700
00:52:38,912 --> 00:52:41,912
君の目にどう映るかな
I wonder how it looks in your eyes?

701
00:52:41,912 --> 00:52:44,412
青より澄み渡る
It's clearer than any blue,

702
00:52:44,412 --> 00:52:48,712
僕だけの大空だと言いな
I hope I can call it my very own wide open sky.

703
00:52:48,712 --> 00:52:50,912
不確かな永遠より僕は
Rather than an uncertain eternity,

704
00:52:50,912 --> 00:52:53,212
二人で過ごす今を歌いたいんだ
I want to sing of the "now" we spend together.

705
00:52:53,212 --> 00:52:54,912
この惑星の片隅続く
Continuing in a corner of this planet,

706
00:52:54,912 --> 00:52:57,112
あいまいみーゆえに
because of our ambiguity...

707
00:52:57,112 --> 00:52:58,912
ラブミ！
...love me!

708
00:53:04,412 --> 00:53:07,012
ナンセンスな現実が
When nonsensical realities

709
00:53:07,012 --> 00:53:09,412
心を乱していった
begin to cloud my mind,

710
00:53:09,412 --> 00:53:12,012
ラッキーの天秤の裏側にある
on the other side of the scales of luck...

711
00:53:12,012 --> 00:53:14,512
アンラッキー
...lies bad luck.

712
00:53:14,512 --> 00:53:16,812
転んだって泣いたって僕ら
Even if we fall or cry,

713
00:53:16,812 --> 00:53:19,912
立ち上がる七転八倒さ
we will stand back up, struggling through life!

714
00:53:19,912 --> 00:53:24,712
笑ってくれてありがとう まだ僕は走れるよ
Thank you for smiling. Now I can keep running.

715
00:53:24,712 --> 00:53:27,412
人生の期待感は
The expectations of life

716
00:53:27,412 --> 00:53:30,012
正直膨らむばっかでさ
honestly just keep on growing,

717
00:53:30,012 --> 00:53:34,312
君の心の中 灯るひだまりなのです
becoming a sunny spot lit up inside your heart.

718
00:53:34,312 --> 00:53:36,912
僕らが暮らしてる
In this miraculous era

719
00:53:36,912 --> 00:53:39,312
奇跡の時代
that we are living in,

720
00:53:39,312 --> 00:53:42,312
君のことどう照らすかな
I wonder how I can shine upon you?

721
00:53:42,312 --> 00:53:44,912
星より煌めいた
Shining brighter than any star,

722
00:53:44,912 --> 00:53:49,212
僕らしい太陽になれたら
if only I could become a sun like myself.

723
00:53:49,212 --> 00:53:51,412
不確かな永遠より僕は
Rather than an uncertain eternity,

724
00:53:51,412 --> 00:53:53,712
二人で過ごす今を楽しんでいたい
I want to enjoy the "now" we spend together.

725
00:53:53,712 --> 00:53:54,912
この惑星の片隅続く
Continuing in a corner of this planet,

726
00:53:54,912 --> 00:53:56,112
あいまいみーゆえに楽しんで
because of our ambiguity, let's enjoy it!

727
00:53:56,312 --> 00:53:59,312
今日は本当にありがとうございました！
Thank you so much for today!

728
00:53:59,312 --> 00:54:02,512
ここまで活動できたのは応援してくれたみんなのおかげです！
Being able to do this for so long is all thanks to everyone's support!

729
00:54:02,512 --> 00:54:05,412
いつも本当にありがとう！
Thank you so much as always!

730
00:54:05,412 --> 00:54:08,412
みんな、大好きだぞー！
I love you all!

731
00:54:14,912 --> 00:54:17,412
健やかなる時も
In sickness and in health,

732
00:54:17,412 --> 00:54:19,912
病める時もきっと
and through any difficult times,

733
00:54:19,912 --> 00:54:24,412
伝えたいよこのメロディ
I surely want to convey this melody to you.

734
00:54:24,412 --> 00:54:26,912
僕らが出会えた
In this miraculous world

735
00:54:26,912 --> 00:54:29,412
奇跡のセカイ
where we were able to meet,

736
00:54:29,412 --> 00:54:32,412
君の目にどう映るかな
I wonder how it looks in your eyes?

737
00:54:32,412 --> 00:54:34,912
青より澄み渡る
It's clearer than any blue,

738
00:54:34,912 --> 00:54:39,212
僕だけの大空だと言いな
I hope I can call it my very own wide open sky.

739
00:54:39,212 --> 00:54:41,412
不確かな永遠より僕は
Rather than an uncertain eternity,

740
00:54:41,412 --> 00:54:43,712
二人で過ごす今を歌いたいんだ
I want to sing of the "now" we spend together.

741
00:54:43,712 --> 00:54:45,912
この惑星の片隅続く
Continuing in a corner of this planet,

742
00:54:45,912 --> 00:54:46,912
あいまいみーゆえに
because of our ambiguity...

743
00:54:46,912 --> 00:54:47,912
ラブミ！
...love me!

744
00:54:47,912 --> 00:54:49,912
アイラブユー伝えたいの
I want to tell you "I love you"!

745
00:57:24,633 --> 00:57:33,133
これからも、楽しい事いっぱい一緒にやろうね！
Let's keep doing lots of fun things together!

